            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present application provides a tire maintenance means, comprising: a monitoring module for monitoring the status of a tire, the status includes a pressure of the tire; an inflating module for inflating or deflating the tire; a repairing module for filling a sealant to the tire; a control module for maintaining the tire based on a signal from the monitoring module. A method of maintaining a tire is also provided in the present application.</p>
